OL,3,GNEWSACharity buys Third Eye centre and
OL,4,ACCA archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity that manages Glasgow's
OL,7,Fmuseum and library collections has
OL,8,Fbought the archive of two organisations
OL,9,Fthat played a key role in the city's
OL,10,Fcontemporary art scene.
OL,12,FThe collections of the Third Eye Centre
OL,13,Fand the Centre for Contemporary Arts
OL,14,F(CCA), containing material gathered
OL,15,Fover more than 50 years, are now owned
OL,16,Fby Glasgow Life.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
