OL,3,GNEWSACharity buys Third Eye centre and
OL,4,ACCA archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FItems include exhibition records,
OL,7,Fphotographs, films, posters, flyers and
OL,8,Fartists' letters, providing a record of
OL,9,Fthe people and work that helped
OL,10,Festablish Glasgow as a centre for
OL,11,Fcontemporary art.
OL,13,FThe acquisition follows the closure of
OL,14,Fthe CCA and the sale of its Sauchiehall
OL,15,FStreet building and assets.
